# Mizentia Backup System Ignore Rules
# These patterns describe which folders and files should NEVER be backed up.

# Dependencies & Build artifacts
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/build/

# Git history & credentials
**/.git/

# Backup System files & caches
**/.tmp.drivedownload/
**/.tmp.driveupload/
config.json
state.json

